godot/pull/110778.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-11T01:12:37Z"},"body":"This PR adds support for the new [XR_KHR_generic_controller](https://registry.khronos.org/OpenXR/specs/1.1/html/xrspec.html#XR_KHR_generic_controller) extension that became available in OpenXR 1.1.52 (#110777)\r\n\r\nThis is a new generic controller profile added to OpenXR that is represents the norm in XR controllers and should provide a suitable fallback where the \"simple controller\" profile is insufficient.\r\n\r\nMarking this as a draft PR for now as we're awaiting confirmation which runtimes have added support for this extension.\r\n\r\nOnce enough runtimes support this new controller profile we'll have to have a discussion whether we'll restrict our default action map to this profile alongside the hand interaction profile.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110778/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issue